# SIBKL Mobile App

React Native church operations app: Expo 53 + Expo Router + Firebase Auth/FCM + TanStack Query + Zustand + NativeWind + CASL.

## Folder Map

- `app/` — Expo Router screens (`(auth)/` unauthenticated, `(app)/` tabbed app)
- `components/` — UI grouped by feature (Cells, Flows, People, shared/)
- `hooks/` — React Query hooks (`useXxxQuery`, `useXxxMutation`)
- `services/` — API calls + types (`*.service.ts`, `*.type.ts`)
- `stores/` — Zustand (`authStore`, `signUpStore`, `claimStore`)
- `utils/` — `secureFetch`, `endpoints`, CASL, helpers
- `config/` — feature flags, toast config

## Conventions

- Import with `@/` path alias (maps to project root)
- Add API paths to `utils/endpoints.ts`; never hardcode base URLs in services
- Gate pilot features via `config/featureFlags.ts` — never read `PILOT_BUILD` in components
- Backend enforces auth; client CASL is UX-only
- Minimize diff scope; match existing naming and file placement
- Do not commit `.env*` files or Firebase credential JSON/plist secrets

## Environments

- `APP_ENV` + `API_URL` come from `.env.development` / `.env.staging` / `.env.production`
- Scripts: `npm run android:dev`, `ios:staging`, etc. (see `package.json`)
